        <paragraph>$$(f-g)(x)=3 x 2 - x-5 , (f-g)(x)=3 x 2 - x-5 ,$$ domain: $$[5,\infty ) [5,\infty )$$</paragraph>
        <paragraph>$$(fg)(x)=3 x 2 x-5 , (fg)(x)=3 x 2 x-5 ,$$ domain: $$[5,\infty ) [5,\infty )$$</paragraph>
        <paragraph>$$( f g )(x)= 3 x 2 x-5 , ( f g )(x)= 3 x 2 x-5 ,$$ domain: $$(5,\infty ) (5,\infty )$$</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
