      </problem>
    </exercise>
    <exercise number="95" has_solution="true">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>Use the function you found in the previous exercise to find the total area burned after 5 minutes.</paragraph>
      </problem>
      <solution>
        <paragraph>$$A(5)=\pi ( 2(5)+1 ) 2 =121\pi A(5)=\pi ( 2(5)+1 ) 2 =121\pi$$ square units</paragraph>
      </solution>
    </exercise>
